{"articleNo":"427537","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_02.do?mode=view&articleNo=427537&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"[교내행사] [학생상담센터]4월 월간 심리검사 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2023.03.21","hit":"2893","attachments":[],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"margin-top: 1em; margin-bottom: 1em; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, 돋움, Dotum, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); word-break: break-all;\"><strong style=\"font-size: 20px; line-height: 1;\">-검사는 온라인으로 진행되며, 해석특강은 학생상담센터에서 대면으로 진행합니다</strong><br></p><p style=\"margin-top: 1em; margin-bottom: 1em; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, 돋움, Dotum, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><span style=\"line-height: 1;\">-신청기간 :&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size: 18pt;\"> </span><u><span style=\"font-size: 18pt;\">MLST 1차(3.22 ~ 3. 30), MLST&nbsp;2차(3. 22 ~ 4. 5)</span></u></span></span></p><p style=\"margin-top: 1em; margin-bottom: 1em; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, 돋움, Dotum, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px; line-height: 1;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18pt;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; </span><u><span style=\"font-size: 18pt;\">&nbsp;대인관계 검사&nbsp;1차(3. 22 ~ 3. 31), 대인관계 검사&nbsp;2차(3.22&nbsp;~ 4. 4)</span></u></span></p><p style=\"margin-top: 1em; margin-bottom: 1em; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, 돋움, Dotum, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px; line-height: 1;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18pt;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; </span><u><span style=\"font-size: 18pt;\">&nbsp;MBTI 3차(3.22 ~ 4. 6), MBTI 4차&nbsp;(3.22 ~ 4. 7), MBTI 5차(3.22 ~ 4.12)</span></u></span></p><p style=\"margin-top: 1em; margin-bottom: 1em; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, 돋움, Dotum, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px; line-height: 1;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18pt;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</span><u><span style=\"font-size: 18pt;\">Holland 3차(3.22 ~ 4.11)</span></u></span></p><p style=\"margin-top: 1em; margin-bottom: 1em; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, 돋움, Dotum, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); word-break: break-all;\"><strong style=\"font-size: 20px; line-height: 1;\">※<span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 94, 0); color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">선착순 마감</span></strong></p><p style=\"margin-top: 1em; margin-bottom: 1em; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, 돋움, Dotum, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><strong style=\"line-height: 1;\">-신청방법 : 학생역량관리시스템(BISKIT) -&nbsp;월간 심리검사 신청</strong></span><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><strong style=\"line-height: 1;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</strong></span><a href=\"https://biskit.kumoh.ac.kr/index.do\" style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: inherit; font-family: 돋움; font-size: 16px;\">금오공과대학교 학생역량관리시스템 (kumoh.ac.kr)</a></p><p style=\"margin-top: 1em; margin-bottom: 1em; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, 돋움, Dotum, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><strong style=\"line-height: 1;\">-검사실시 : 신청자에게 개별 금오톡톡 발송- 온라인으로 검사 실시</strong></span></p><p style=\"margin-top: 1em; margin-bottom: 1em; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, 돋움, Dotum, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><strong style=\"line-height: 1;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;*해석특강 전까지 심리검사 실시 완료되어야 해석특강에 참여하실 수 있습니다.&nbsp;</strong></span></p><p style=\"margin-top: 1em; margin-bottom: 1em; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, 돋움, Dotum, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><strong style=\"line-height: 1;\">-해석특강 완료시 <span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">취업진로상담 교과목 수료, BISKIT 마일리지 지급</span></strong></span></p><p style=\"margin-top: 1em; margin-bottom: 1em; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, 돋움, Dotum, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); word-break: break-all;\"><br></p><p style=\"margin-top: 1em; margin-bottom: 1em; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, 돋움, Dotum, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><strong style=\"line-height: 1;\"><br></strong></span></p><p style=\"margin-top: 1em; margin-bottom: 1em; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, 돋움, Dotum, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">-문의 : 학생상담센터 채은정(054-478-7934)</span></p><p style=\"margin-top: 1em; margin-bottom: 1em; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, 돋움, Dotum, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); word-break: break-all;\"><br></p><p style=\"margin-top: 1em; margin-bottom: 1em; padding-top: 0px; font-family